# APC-AA browser support target
#
# Matches Baseline Widely Available: features supported in all core browsers
# (Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari) for at least 30 months. "with downstream"
# also accounts for Chromium-based minority browsers (Samsung Internet, etc.).
#
# Native Browserslist syntax — supported by Stylelint, PostCSS, Autoprefixer,
# cssnano, esbuild, Babel, Lightning CSS. Verify with: npx browserslist

baseline widely available with downstream
